--
-- Reconcile existing jobs by name before creating; never create duplicate schedules.
-- Observe pg_net response status only, not request headers/secret values. The JSON
-- scheduled payload is constant. One run claims at most one account job (lease2min),
-- or cleans at most3 eligible orphan objects. Failed claims expire and retry.
-- Verify job completion even after the user closes the app. Alert an operator on
